# AB-003: Resolve the first two phosphoric-acid equivalence regions
# Candidate experiment; expected observations are not measured results.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 H3PO4 0.001mol
measure v1 ph
add v1 NaOH 0.0005mol
measure v1 ph
add v1 NaOH 0.0005mol
measure v1 ph
add v1 NaOH 0.0005mol
measure v1 ph
add v1 NaOH 0.0005mol
measure v1 ph
inspect
